@startuml shareable-link-state
' Context: shareable-link
' Profile: client
' SDD: PROM-SHAREABLE-LINK
' Revision: 2026-07-25
' Sequence: seq-open-from-fragment.puml
' Statechart: ShareableLinkMachine (client/lib/machines/shareable-link/)

title Shareable-link — parse fragment, coda e risoluzione

state Idle : nessun target in coda
state TargetQueued : SharedLinkPending\n(targetDeferred)
state Resolving : ResolveSharedLink in corso
state NotFound : SharedLinkInvalid\n(profileNotFound)

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> TargetQueued : ParseFragment\n[fragment valido]
TargetQueued --> TargetQueued : ParseFragment\n[stesso target]
TargetQueued --> TargetQueued : ParseFragment\n[nuovo target]
TargetQueued --> Idle : ParseFragment\n[fragment assente o riservato]

Idle --> Idle : ParseFragment\n[fragment assente]
NotFound --> Idle : ParseFragment\n[fragment assente]
NotFound --> Idle : DismissNotFound

TargetQueued --> TargetQueued : HandleTargetRequested\n/ SessionBecameReady\n[!sessionReady || !hasOpenAccounts]
TargetQueued --> TargetQueued : HandleTargetRequested\n/ SessionBecameReady\n[focusedUserId null]
TargetQueued --> Resolving : HandleTargetRequested\n/ SessionBecameReady\n[sessione pronta]

Resolving --> NotFound : ResolveSharedLink\n[indirizzo non risolvibile]
Resolving --> NotFound : ResolveSharedLink\n[profilo assente]
Resolving --> Idle : ResolveSharedLink\n[self peer — ignorato]
Resolving --> Idle : OpenSharedChat\n→ navigation
Resolving --> Idle : OpenSharedProfile\n→ overlay profilo

note right of TargetQueued
  Domain: SharedLinkPending
  Eventi: ParseFragment, SessionBecameReady
end note

note right of Resolving
  Effetti: findProfileByUsername,
  openChatFromLink, showProfileOverlay
  Vedi seq-open-from-fragment.puml
end note

note right of NotFound
  Domain: SharedLinkInvalid
  UI dismiss → DismissNotFound → Idle
end note

@enduml
